{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And the water was exhausted from the skin.</b> Before she reached the lodging place, for Abraham had given her only a measure of water so that she would reach a settlement, but she went and lost her way." "<b>And she cast the child.</b> Not because he had been on her shoulder from the time she left Abraham's house; rather, when he became ill she placed him on her shoulder, and when she saw that his soul was departing she cast him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:10.185602143Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}